    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>RECOMMENDED FOR YOU</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>The Gameplay</strong><br><u>Let's get some slimes!</u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/b17fa66fd5b54c46c73accf816c3b36e.poster.avif?t=1692399406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/b17fa66fd5b54c46c73accf816c3b36e.webm?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/b17fa66fd5b54c46c73accf816c3b36e.mp4?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>With a limited movement, you need to think carefully about every step until you reach the door. <br>Sometimes the door will need keys.</u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/60468c6b46ebbd05da8f915d525db769.poster.avif?t=1692399406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/60468c6b46ebbd05da8f915d525db769.webm?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/60468c6b46ebbd05da8f915d525db769.mp4?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>You will need to attack! Every level you have a specific quantity of daggers to use in the slimes.</u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/0ea80ab4870629d636d9a597bf4eca48.poster.avif?t=1692399406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/0ea80ab4870629d636d9a597bf4eca48.webm?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/0ea80ab4870629d636d9a597bf4eca48.mp4?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>Be wise when you gonna strike!</u><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2666 4 Worlds with unique environments<br>\u2666 35 hand-craft levels<br>\u2666 Difficulty progression for a growing challenge over the levels<br>\u2666 Beautiful pixel art<br>\u2666 A lot of slimes to slay!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The Gameplay</strong><br><u>Let's get some slimes!</u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/b17fa66fd5b54c46c73accf816c3b36e.poster.avif?t=1692399406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/b17fa66fd5b54c46c73accf816c3b36e.webm?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/b17fa66fd5b54c46c73accf816c3b36e.mp4?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>With a limited movement, you need to think carefully about every step until you reach the door. <br>Sometimes the door will need keys.</u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/60468c6b46ebbd05da8f915d525db769.poster.avif?t=1692399406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/60468c6b46ebbd05da8f915d525db769.webm?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/60468c6b46ebbd05da8f915d525db769.mp4?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>You will need to attack! Every level you have a specific quantity of daggers to use in the slimes.</u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/0ea80ab4870629d636d9a597bf4eca48.poster.avif?t=1692399406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/0ea80ab4870629d636d9a597bf4eca48.webm?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161120/extras/0ea80ab4870629d636d9a597bf4eca48.mp4?t=1692399406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><u>Be wise when you gonna strike!</u><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2666 4 Worlds with unique environments<br>\u2666 35 hand-craft levels<br>\u2666 Difficulty progression for a growing challenge over the levels<br>\u2666 Beautiful pixel art<br>\u2666 A lot of slimes to slay!",
    "short_description": "You are on a quest to find and defeat the Slime King. With a limited movement, you need to think carefully about every step until you reach the door. Push boxes, find keys, beware of traps, and slay every slime that get in your way!",
